  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.1 — Catalog bump to whfmt.FileFormatCatalog 1.3.2 (Phase B audit + 2 bug fixes, 799 definitions, schema v3 canonical). FuzzMutation enum extended (Lot 4) with byte_swap / truncate / duplicate mutations. No Fuzz API changes. 1.1.0 — Format-aware fuzzing leveraging whfmt.fuzz.strategies, weighted mutation selection, JSON corpus manifest. 1.0.0 — Initial release. FormatFuzzer.Generate() with mutation strategies, checksum recomputation, and corpus export.",
